# Python

- Python 3.12+, typed, Pydantic v2 models for agent I/O.
- SQLAlchemy 2.x mapped models in `backend/ame/db/models/`.
- New tables need Alembic migrations. Use UUIDs and timezone-aware UTC timestamps.
- Keep modules focused. No 4,000-line service files.
- Structured JSON logs with `correlation_id`, `workflow_id`, `agent_run_id`, `content_id` when available.
- Publishers implement `PublisherAdapter` from `ame.publishers.base`.
- Agents implement `ame.agents.base.Agent`.
- Cost events must be written for every paid provider call.
